source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191690/extras/6e3ea66b91f58fb2407512b06b4f2485.webm?t=1735663664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Express yourself through your character's appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from multiple options and sliders to create your ideal look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordinating outfits with teammates or stand out as the investigator with your own style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191690/extras/eeec3675b29a202c3a18d0dd4bfca623.avif?t=1735663664\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the 37 ghost types and the abilities that set them apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a variety of exhilarating hunts that will test your survival skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in proximity-based communication with the ethereal realm by speaking into your microphone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191690/extras/b67d1b4713b79a883713e13bc6ad5439.avif?t=1735663664\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ectoplasm is a living, breathing horror experience that will evolve over time. Expect regular updates that bring new maps, items, mechanics, and even ghost types to ensure the terror never grows stale. The supernatural world is vast, and your journey into the unknown has only just begun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face your fears and survive the relentless onslaught of the supernatural in Ectoplasm. Are you ready to walk the thin line between life and death?</p>",
